## Unrelated MCP Gateway UI (Next.js) — example config

## Gateway admin/control plane base (UI server -> Gateway). Usually private/internal.
GATEWAY_ADMIN_BASE=http://gateway:4001

## Gateway data plane base URL that end-users will copy into their MCP client config.
## This should be reachable from the user's MCP client environment.
GATEWAY_DATA_BASE=http://localhost:27100
